1
00:00:00,153 --> 00:00:03,917
Tasavvur qiling: uchta yuragingiz bor-u, baribir ko‘nglingiz sinsa!

2
00:00:03,957 --> 00:00:08,105
Ahtapotning ko‘ngli aslida sinmaydi, lekin uchta yuragi chindan bor!

3
00:00:08,155 --> 00:00:10,795
Ikkita yurak qonni jabralar orqali haydaydi.

4
00:00:10,835 --> 00:00:12,957
Uchinchisi esa uni butun tanaga tarqatadi.

5
00:00:12,997 --> 00:00:14,592
Qoni-chi? Ko‘k!

6
00:00:14,632 --> 00:00:18,035
Kislorodni tashish uchun u temir emas, mis ishlatadi.

7
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:19,768
Uchta yurak, ko‘k qon?

8
00:00:19,808 --> 00:00:21,391
Bu mind-blowing, ya’ni aqlni shoshiradigan!

9
00:00:21,431 --> 00:00:23,365
Ma’nosi: nihoyatda hayratlanarli.

10
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:25,005
Aqlni shoshiradigan fakt!

11
00:00:25,068 --> 00:00:27,749
Ahtapot sizga “Yuragim sizniki” desa...

12
00:00:27,789 --> 00:00:28,751
...qaysi biri ekan?
